ocked (Condition)\">Shocked</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Electrocuted_(Condition)\" title=\"Electrocuted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/26px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/39px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/52px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrocuted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp/26px-Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"26\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cd/Electrocuted_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Electrocuted_(Condition)\" title=\"Electrocuted (Condition)\">Electrocuted</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jolted_(Condition)\" title=\"Jolted (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jolted\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/Jolted_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jolted_(Condition)\" title=\"Jolted (Condition)\">Jolted</a>, or otherwise affected by lightning.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"