f Copper Shavings\">Salts of Copper Shavings</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Machinery\" title=\"Broken Machinery\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Broken_Machinery_C_Item_Icon.png/20px-Broken_Machinery_C_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Broken_Machinery_C_Item_Icon.png/30px-Broken_Machinery_C_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Broken_Machinery_C_Item_Icon.png/40px-Broken_Machinery_C_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Broken_Machinery_C_Item_Icon.png/20px-Broken_Machinery_C_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Broken_Machinery_C_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Broken_Machinery\" title=\"Broken Machinery\">Broken Machinery</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Suspension</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This elixir also grants immunity to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Static_Discharge_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Static Discharge Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Static Discharge Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Static_Discharge_Aura_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20